	"title"		"Zam's Collectibles: TCG | 扎姆收藏品：集换式卡牌"
	"description"		"Zamco Electronics brings the Aug Warriors trading card game to the station. Open packs, chase rares, grade your best pulls, seal complete sets, and play the game at the back table of a card shop that only opens after hours.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dysonzed/Zams-Collectibles/main/workshop/banner_multiplayer.png[/img]
Send your Aug Warriors deck to your friends. Any deck box can copy its deck as a short deck code. Paste a friend's code at the Downside Den and play against their deck, played by the AI the way they built it.
[list]
[*]Share codes anywhere text goes: Discord, Steam chat, the comments below
[*]Free practice any night the Den is open: no ante, and it doesn't use up your game with the regulars
[*]Got a deck you're proud of? Post its code in the comments and see who can beat it
[/list]

[h2]Ten sets, three tiers[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Tier 1:[/b] Rustwave Rising, Doomed Decay, Oxygen Leak
[*][b]Tier 2:[/b] Restored Grace, Broodmother's Clutch, Neural Tap, Fate's End
[*][b]Tier 3:[/b] Ascension, Singularity, Recursion
[*]Over 120 cards, each set with its own theme, rarity mix, pack art and booster box
[*]Ultra rares in roughly 1 of every 100 packs of their set
[*]Higher tiers are stronger and pricier, and must be licensed from Zamco through Wild's Network
[/list]

[h2]Collect[/h2]
[list]
[*]Booster packs and booster boxes; boxes are the better buy
[*]Every card has a hidden condition you judge by its wear. Most packs are well travelled: clean cards are a real find, and a perfect gem 10 is a true jackpot
[*]Playing wears your cards down. Sleeve your best ones with card sleeves from the Den
[*]The Card Grader seals your cards in graded slabs, with a big premium for top grades
[*]Seal a complete set in a Collector's Box for a bonus; include the ultra rare for a Master Set, worth twice the bonus
[*]Collection binders, deck boxes, and a Collectible item category only the right customers buy
[*]Binders, deck boxes and the other card containers fit in your backpack, so your collection can come along to the Den
[*]Double-click any card to see it full size, even singles for sale and your opponent's cards, and open as many as you like side by side
[*]The economy is tuned per tier: Tier 1 is a gamble, Tier 3 pays back the investment
[/list]

[h2]The Downside Den[/h2]
[list]
[*]Unlock a card shop down in the lower section through Wild's Network
[*]Downside Dan sells fresh packs, boxes and singles six nights a week (the Den is closed on Sundays) and buys cards over the counter
[*]Arrive with the Zamco Stockist Guide (how to play, how to read a card, deck building) and an Authorized Dealer Certificate: hang it in your display case to draw card customers
[/list]

[h2]Aug Warriors[/h2]
[list]
[*]Build a mercenary one augment at a time: push your Power, keep your Glitch under your Stability, and call the showdown at the right moment
[*]Dozens of card effects: hacks, mod stealing, extra actions, swarm synergies and more
[*]Play the Den's regulars for credits or cards, one game a night. Each save has its own regulars with hidden play styles, and one of them, Oracle, is very, very good
[*]Oracle plays for high stakes: antes of 100, 250 or 500 credits that pay three times over, or a card ante that wins you two cards and a booster pack
[*]Card customers may challenge you to a game at your counter
[*]Share decks with friends as deck codes and play each other's decks at the Den
[/list]

[h2]Customers[/h2]
[list]
[*]Put collectibles in your display case and card buyers come for them, just like the game's own goods: a fan, a player, or a big-spending investor, depending on what you show
[*]Pack flippers who sell you packs below Dan's prices
[*]Deck builders who hand you a box and a wish list, shown on your shop tablet
[*]The Card Grader, who takes your cards away for a day and brings them back slabbed
[*]A rare Set Collector who comes looking for sealed sets, and grows more likely to visit the longer one sits on your shelf
[/list]

[h2]New start: Card Dealer[/h2]
Begin with the Den open, three booster packs, a deck box and a binder.

[h2]Notes[/h2]
This is an early version: expect rough edges. The Tier 1 sets, Restored Grace and Broodmother's Clutch have their full card art; the other sets still use placeholder art. Text is in English and Simplified Chinese.

Save warning: cards, packs, boxes and the other items from this mod disappear from your store if you disable or remove it.

[h2]中文简介[/h2]
Zamco 电子把 Aug Warriors 集换式卡牌游戏带到了空间站。拆补充包、追稀有卡、给最好的卡评级、封装完整套装，还能在一家只在打烊后营业的卡牌店后桌打牌。
[list]
[*]十个系列，分三个强度等级；高等级系列需通过 Wild 的网络向 Zamco 购买授权
[*]超过 120 张卡牌，每个系列都有自己的主题、补充包和补充盒；超稀有卡约每 100 包出一张
[*]每张卡都有隐藏品相，满分 10 分是真正的大奖；评级师会把卡封进评级盒
[*]打牌会磨损卡牌，用卡套保护你最好的卡
[*]用收藏盒封装完整套装获得加成，加入超稀有卡即为大师套装
[*]Downside Den 卡牌店（周日休息）：新到的补充包、补充盒和单卡，以及后桌的常客对手，每晚可对战一局
[*]完整的 Aug Warriors 卡牌对战：常客各有隐藏的打法风格，其中 Oracle 极其难缠
[*]准多人模式：把卡组复制成卡组代码发给好友，在 Downside Den 与彼此的卡组对战（免费练习）
[*]在展示柜里摆放收藏品，就会吸引卡牌买家上门
[*]新顾客：补充包贩子、组卡客、卡牌评级师和稀有的套装收藏家；新开局：卡牌经销商
[/list]
支持简体中文。注意：停用或移除本模组后，其物品会从你的商店中消失。"
	"changenote"		"Version 0.3.4: drawing from an empty deck now has a cost, deck counts on the board, and a smarter AI with draw cards.

Aug Warriors
- Drawing from an empty deck overloads your system: each draw that finds no card adds 1 Glitch. Thin decks packed with draw cards now have a risk to weigh. A draw stopped by the hand limit still costs nothing, and no existing deck becomes illegal
- The board shows how many cards are left in each deck, next to Power
- The match log says when someone draws from an empty deck
- The AI values draw cards by the cards actually left in its deck, so it plays them better late in a game
- The Stockist Guide's rules page explains the new rule

Fixes
- The Stockist Guide's page counter fits again (it showed Page 10/1 on two lines), and its arrows no longer crowd it

版本 0.3.4：从空牌库抽牌会有代价，对战板显示牌库数量，AI 更会使用抽牌效果。
- 从空牌库抽牌会让系统过载：每次没抽到牌，故障 +1。手牌已满时抽不到牌不受影响，现有卡组均不会变为不合规
- 对战板在力量旁显示双方牌库剩余张数；对战记录会提示从空牌库抽牌
- AI 按牌库实际剩余张数评估抽牌效果
- 修复：指南页码显示不全的问题"
}
